remixes: 4.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, bento, dither, charts, navigation.\n## Overview\nAura Mobile Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\n11:30 Welcome to Aura Step 2 Aura Connected Last Sync 7:15 am Check for Pairing Mode Scroll 11:30 Vitality Dashboard Heart Rate 23.8 Metabolic Age 85-115 Moderate 108 bpm Zone 1 Longevity Score Pace of Aging 0.7x slower…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Vitality Dashboard; Longevity Score; Steady and Healthy.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #A3E635, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #A3E635, background #FFFFFF, surface #333333, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aura - Mobile Flow</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #8e927cff; /* green-900 fallback */\n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center;\n            background-attachment: fixed;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n        }\n\n        /* Custom Scrollbar for the main container */\n        .scroller::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 6px; }\n        .scroller::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }\n        .scroller::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #333; border-radius: 10px; }\n\n        /* Hide scrollbar for internal phone screens */\n        .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n        .no-scrollbar { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }\n\n        /* Subtle Gradient Borders */\n        .glass-panel {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .glass-panel::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            padding: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 100%);\n            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .gradient-border-b {\n            border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;\n            border-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), transparent) 1;\n        }\n\n        /* Fluid Blob Animations */\n        @keyframes blob-float {\n            0% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1) rotate(0deg); }\n            33% { transform: translate(20px, -30px) scale(1.1) rotate(5deg); }\n            66% { transform: translate(-10px, 20px) scale(0.95) rotate(-5deg); }\n            100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1) rotate(0deg); }\n        }\n        @keyframes blob-float-slow {\n            0% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1.2) rotate(0deg); }\n            50% { transform: translate(-30px, 40px) scale(1) rotate(10deg); }\n            100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1.2) rotate(0deg); }\n        }\n\n        .blob-1 {\n            animation: blob-float 12s infinite cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(163, 230, 53, 0.8) 0%, rgba(163, 230, 53, 0) 70%);\n        }\n        .blob-2 {\n            animation: blob-float-slow 18s infinite cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) reverse;\n            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(163, 230, 53, 0.6) 0%, rgba(163, 230, 53, 0) 70%);\n        }\n\n        /* Graph Animation */\n        @keyframes draw-line {\n            to { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }\n        }\n        .graph-line {\n            stroke-dasharray: 1000;\n            stroke-dashoffset: 1000;\n            animation: draw-line 2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) forwards;\n        }\n\n        /* Masked Text Reveal utility */\n        .reveal-wrapper { overflow: hidden; display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; }\n        .reveal-text { display: inline-block; transform: translateY(110%); }\n\n        /* Custom Range Slider */\n        input[type=range] {\n            -webkit-appearance: none;\n            width: 100%;\n            background: transparent;\n        }\n        input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb {\n            -webkit-appearance: none;\n            height: 16px; width: 4px;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            background: #a3e635; /* lime-400 */\n            cursor: pointer;\n            margin-top: -6px;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(163, 230, 53, 0.5);\n        }\n        input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-runnable-track {\n            width: 100%; height: 4px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        /* Pulse animation for active dot */\n        @keyframes pulse-dot {\n            0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(163, 230, 53, 0.4); }\n            70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(163, 230, 53, 0); }\n            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(163, 230, 53, 0); }\n        }\n        .status-dot {\n            animation: pulse-dot 2s infinite;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-start lg:justify-center p-6 lg:p-12 overflow-x-auto scroller\">\n\n    <div class=\"flex gap-8 mx-auto w-max\">\n\n        <!-- ==================== SCREEN 1: CONNECTION ==================== -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-[340px] h-[740px] bg-[#0c0c0e] rounded-[40px] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-white/5 flex flex-col shrink-0\">\n\n            <!-- Abstract Background Effects -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-96 h-96 blob-1 opacity-70 mix-blend-screen filter blur-[40px]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -left-20 w-80 h-80 blob-2 opacity-50 mix-blend-screen filter blur-[50px]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Curved path graphic behind content -->\n            <svg class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[120%] h-auto opacity-30 pointer-events-none\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 400\" fill=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M-50,200 Q150,50 350,300 T450,100\" stroke=\"#a3e635\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" fill=\"none\" />\n                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"200\" r=\"140\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" />\n                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"200\" r=\"140\" stroke=\"#a3e635\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"200 800\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" transform=\"rotate(-90 200 200)\" />\n            </svg>\n\n            <!-- Status Bar -->\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center px-6 pt-5 pb-2 text-white/80 text-[11px] font-medium z-10\">\n                <span>11:30</span>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:celluler-bold\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wifi-bold\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:battery-charge-bold\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Top Header Pill -->\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center px-4 mt-2 z-10\">\n                <div class=\"glass-panel px-4 py-2 rounded-full flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/80 tracking-wide font-light\">Welcome to Aura</span>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full glass-panel flex items-center justify-center text-white/60 hover:text-white transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:close-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Main Content Area -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative z-10 mt-10\">\n\n                <!-- Floating Info Badge -->\n                <div class=\"glass-panel px-5 py-3 rounded-2xl mb-8 transform -translate-x-4 rotate-[-2deg]\">\n                    <div class=\"text-[10px] text-lime-400 mb-0.5 tracking-wider uppercase\">Step 2</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-sm text-white/90 font-light tracking-wide\">Aura Connected</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"text-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-[11px] text-white/40 font-light mb-1\">Last Sync</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-xs text-white/80 font-light\">7:15 am</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Section -->\n            <div class=\"px-6 pb-8 z-10 flex flex-col gap-6\">\n                <!-- Check Mode Badge -->\n                <div class=\"glass-panel px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full flex items-center gap-3 w-max\">\n                    <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-lime-400 opacity-60\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-white/60 font-light\">Check for Pairing Mode</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Action Bar -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n                    <button class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full glass-panel flex items-center justify-center text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-left-linear\" width=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 glass-panel h-12 rounded-full flex items-center p-1 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"w-20 h-full bg-lime-400 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(163,230,53,0.3)]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-read-linear\" class=\"text-black\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 flex justify-end pr-4 opacity-50\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:double-alt-arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <button class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full glass-panel flex items-center justify-center text-white/60 hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" width=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Vertical Scroll Hint -->\n            <div class=\"absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 opacity-30 z-10\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-up-linear\" width=\"12\"></iconify-icon>\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest writing-vertical-rl transform rotate-180 font-light\">Scroll</div>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" width=\"12\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- ==================== SCREEN 2: DASHBOARD ==================== -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-[340px] h-[740px] bg-[#0c0c0e] rounded-[40px] overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar shadow-2xl border border-white/5 flex flex-col shrink-0\">\n\n            <!-- Status Bar -->\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center px-6 pt-5 pb-2 text-white/80 text-[11px] font-medium sticky top-0 bg-[#0c0c0e]/90 backdrop-blur-md z-50\">\n                <span>11:30</span>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:celluler-bold\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wifi-bold\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:battery-charge-bold\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Header -->\n            <div class=\"px-6 pt-6 pb-4 flex justify-between items-center\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-lg font-normal tracking-tight text-white/90 g-title\">\n                    <span class=\"reveal-wrapper\"><span class=\"reveal-text\">Vitality</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"reveal-wrapper\"><span class=\"reveal-text\">Dashboard</span></span>\n                </h1>\n                <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white/50\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-bold\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"px-6 flex flex-col gap-6 pb-28\">\n                <!-- Heart Rate Section -->\n                <div class=\"\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-lime-400\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-white/70 font-light\">Heart Rate</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mb-6\">\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-lg font-light tracking-tight text-white/90\">23.8</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-white/40 font-light mt-0.5\">Metabolic Age</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-right\">\n                            <div class=\"text-sm font-light text-white/80\">85-115</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-white/40 font-light mt-0.5 flex items-center justify-end gap-1\">\n                                <div class=\"w-0.5 h-0.5 rounded-full bg-white/50\"></div> Moderate\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"text-center mb-4 relative z-10\">\n                        <span class=\"text-5xl font-light tracking-tighter text-white\">108</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm font-light text-white/50 ml-1\">bpm</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Chart Area -->\n                    <div class=\"relative h-32 w-full mt-[-20px]\">\n                        <!-- Background Grid Lines -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between opacity-10 pointer-events-none\">\n                            <div class=\"border-t border-white/20 w-full border-dashed\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"border-t border-white/20 w-full border-dashed\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"border-t border-white/20 w-full border-dashed\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"border-t border-white/20 w-full border-dashed\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <svg class=\"w-full h-full\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                            <defs>\n                                <linearGradient id=\"chart-fill\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n                                    <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#a3e635\" stop-opacity=\"0.2\"/>\n                                    <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#a3e635\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/>\n                                </linearGradient>\n                            </defs>\n                            <!-- Fill -->\n                            <path d=\"M0,60 L20,55 L40,65 L60,50 L80,55 L100,45 L120,50 L140,30 L160,80 L180,60 L200,65 L220,55 L240,60 L260,45 L280,55 L300,50 L300,100 L0,100 Z\" fill=\"url(#chart-fill)\" />\n                            <!-- Line -->\n                            <path class=\"graph-line\" d=\"M0,60 L20,55 L40,65 L60,50 L80,55 L100,45 L120,50 L140,30 L160,80 L180,60 L200,65 L220,55 L240,60 L260,45 L280,55 L300,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a3e635\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n                        </svg>\n\n                        <!-- Floating Heart Icon -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-[45%] left-[50%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full glass-panel flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:heart-linear\" class=\"text-white/80\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Chart Bottom Legend -->\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mt-2 border-t border-white/5 pt-2\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] text-white/40 font-light\">Zone 1</span>\n                        <div class=\"w-16 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-lime-400 to-transparent rounded-full opacity-50\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Divider -->\n                <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-white/5\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Longevity Score Card -->\n                <div class=\"relative\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-red-500\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-white/70 font-light\">Longevity Score</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full glass-panel flex items-center justify-center text-white/50\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\">\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-white/40 font-light mb-1\">Pace of Aging</div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-light text-white\">0.7x</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-white/40 font-light flex items-center gap-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/80\"></div> slower this week\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-right\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-white/40 font-light mb-1\">Aura Age</div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-end gap-1.5\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-light text-white\">26.4</span>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-bold\" class=\"text-lime-400\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Navigation -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-max z-50\">\n                <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-full p-1.5 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <button class=\"w-12 h-10 rounded-full bg-lime-400 flex items-center justify-center text-black shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(163,230,53,0.2)]\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-5-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white/40 hover:text-white/80 transition-colors\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:moon-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white/40 hover:text-white/80 transition-colors\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:link-circle-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white/40 hover:text-white/80 transition-colors\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- ==================== SCREEN 3: DETAIL VIEW ==================== -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-[340px] h-[740px] bg-[#0c0c0e] rounded-[40px] overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar shadow-2xl border border-white/5 flex flex-col shrink-0\">\n\n            <!-- Status Bar -->\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center px-6 pt-5 pb-2 text-white/80 text-[11px] font-medium absolute top-0 w-full z-50\">\n                <span>11:30</span>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:celluler-bold\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wifi-bold\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:battery-charge-bold\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Header -->\n            <div class=\"px-6 pt-14 pb-4 flex justify-between items-center z-10 relative\">\n                <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full glass-panel flex items-center justify-center text-white/70\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-left-linear\" width=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <h2 class=\"text-[13px] font-light tracking-wide text-white/90\">Longevity Score</h2>\n                <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full glass-panel flex items-center justify-center text-white/70\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:info-circle-linear\" width=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Date Selector -->\n            <div class=\"px-6 py-2 flex justify-between items-center text-[11px] font-light z-10 relative border-b border-white/5 pb-4\">\n                <button class=\"text-white/40 flex items-center gap-1\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-left-linear\" width=\"10\"></iconify-icon> Aug 19</button>\n                <span class=\"text-white\">Today</span>\n                <button class=\"text-white/40 flex items-center gap-1\">Aug 26 <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"10\"></iconify-icon></button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- WebGL Canvas Container -->\n            <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"absolute top-24 left-0 w-full h-[350px] z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Visualization Overlay Text -->\n            <div class=\"h-[280px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative z-10 mt-8 pointer-events-none\">\n                <div class=\"text-5xl font-light tracking-tighter text-white drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]\">26.4</div>\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-light text-white/80 mt-1 drop-shadow-md\">Aura Age</div>\n                <div class=\"text-[11px] font-light text-white/50 mt-1 drop-shadow-md\">5.1 years younger</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Content Details -->\n            <div class=\"px-6 flex-1 flex flex-col z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0c0c0e] via-[#0c0c0e] to-transparent pt-10\">\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-6\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/70\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/70 font-light\">Pace of Aging</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Slider Graphic -->\n                <div class=\"mb-8\">\n                    <div class=\"text-center text-lg font-light text-white mb-2\">0.7x</div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between text-[10px] text-white/40 font-light mb-2 px-2\">\n                        <span>Slow</span>\n                        <span>Fast</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full h-10 flex items-center\">\n                        <!-- Tick marks -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex justify-between items-center px-1 opacity-20\">\n                            <!-- Generate a bunch of ticks -->\n                            <script>\n                                for(let i=0; i<40; i++) {\n                                    let h = i%10===0 ? 'h-3' : (i%5===0 ? 'h-2' : 'h-1');\n                                    document.write(`<div class=\"w-px ${h} bg-white\"></div>`);\n                                }\n                            </script>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Range input overlay -->\n                        <input type=\"range\" min=\"-1.8\" max=\"3.0\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" class=\"relative z-10 w-full pointer-events-none\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between text-[10px] text-white/30 font-light mt-1 px-1\">\n                        <span>-1.8x</span>\n                        <span>1.0x</span>\n                        <span>3.0x</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Info Box -->\n                <div class=\"glass-panel p-5 rounded-2xl mb-6\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm font-normal text-white/90 mb-2\">Steady and Healthy</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-white/50 font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                        Your Aura Age is younger and your Pace of Aging is slow, thanks to your consistent routine and active lifestyle over the past month.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // GSAP Animations with ScrollTrigger setup for masked reveals\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const titles = document.querySelectorAll(\".g-title\");\n            titles.forEach((title) => {\n                const scroller = title.closest('.overflow-y-auto') || window;\n                gsap.to(title.querySelectorAll(\".reveal-text\"), {\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: title,\n                        scroller: scroller,\n                        start: \"top 95%\",\n                    },\n                    y: \"0%\",\n                    duration: 0.8,\n                    stagger: 0.1,\n                    ease: \"power3.out\",\n                    delay: 0.2\n                });\n            });\n        });\n\n        // Three.js Particle Sphere setup for Screen 3\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Camera setup\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(50, container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 40;\n\n            // Renderer setup\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(window.devicePixelRatio);\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Particles\n            const particlesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particlesCount = 4000;\n            const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n            const colorsArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n            const colorBase = new THREE.Color(0xa3e635); // lime-400\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i+=3) {\n                // Generate points on a sphere\n                const radius = 15 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2; // base radius with slight noise\n                const theta = Math.random() * 2 * Math.PI;\n                const phi = Math.acos((Math.random() * 2) - 1);\n\n                // Add an indentation/deformation to match reference (half sphere dense, half sparse/flowing)\n                let x = radius * Math.sin(phi) * Math.cos(theta);\n                let y = radius * Math.sin(phi) * Math.sin(theta);\n                let z = radius * Math.cos(phi);\n\n                // Pull points on the right side out a bit to create the sweeping effect\n                if (x > 0) {\n                    x += Math.random() * 8;\n                    y += (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10;\n                }\n\n                posArray[i] = x;\n                posArray[i+1] = y;\n                posArray[i+2] = z;\n\n                // Color variation\n                colorsArray[i] = colorBase.r + (Math.random() * 0.2);\n                colorsArray[i+1] = colorBase.g;\n                colorsArray[i+2] = colorBase.b;\n            }\n\n            particlesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n            particlesGeometry.setAttribute('color', new THREE.BufferAttribute(colorsArray, 3));\n\n            // Material\n            const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.15,\n                vertexColors: true,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.8,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            // Mesh\n            const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(particlesGeometry, material);\n            // Rotate to match reference angle\n            particlesMesh.rotation.x = Math.PI / 4;\n            particlesMesh.rotation.y = -Math.PI / 6;\n            scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            let clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Gentle rotation\n                particlesMesh.rotation.y += 0.002;\n\n                // Slight pulsing effect on vertices\n                const positions = particlesGeometry.attributes.position.array;\n                for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount; i++) {\n                    const i3 = i * 3;\n                    const x = particlesGeometry.attributes.position.array[i3];\n                    // small sine wave offset based on time and position\n                    positions[i3+1] += Math.sin(elapsedTime + x) * 0.005;\n                }\n                particlesGeometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // Initialize WebGL if container exists\n        if(document.getElementById('webgl-container')) {\n            initWebGL();\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aura-mobile-flow-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/aura-mobile-flow-1.jpg", "source_name": "aura-mobile-flow-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 400, "forks": 25, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T11:24:03.587149+00:00"}